# The Original's living room: a right click at (20, 120) misses the exit to the
# street (its click area is x 0-40, y 280-390), so the scene stays 1fsala.
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --headless --ms 4000 --input tools/play/sala-street-door-orig.input
0 scene 1fsala 60 300 1 1 0 0 0
500 rclick 20 120
+1500 expect 1fsala
+0 quit
